# PROJECT: HUMAN.EXE
## THE FUTURE WAS NEVER WRITTEN.
### An immersive 3D interactive storytelling experience

Act as a senior creative developer, 3D web designer, motion graphics artist, frontend architect and interactive storytelling director with extensive experience building award-level digital experiences.

Your task is to DESIGN AND DEVELOP a complete, functional, highly polished website called:

**HUMAN.EXE — THE FUTURE WAS NEVER WRITTEN.**

This is a 24-hour hackathon project under the category:

**Scroll-Based Storytelling & Motion Design.**

This must NOT look like a generic AI-generated landing page, dashboard, portfolio or ordinary history website.

It should feel like entering an unexplored futuristic digital museum, discovering lost memories of humanity and gradually uncovering how technological progress shaped civilization.

The visitor must actively participate in the story.

Every choice must have consequences. Every artifact must have a purpose. Every chapter must feel visually distinct.

